      <h2>Regulatory Changelog</h2>
      <p>We track every regulatory change that affects your compliance status. When the rules change, we notify you before it affects your score.</p>

      <h3>2026</h3>
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:13px;">
        <thead>
          <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">
